{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54777","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 三十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"围彼垒，月角露三星。\n亦（京本作「形」）类三台侵抱月，其城难取枉亡（京本作「劳」）兵，别处设谋赢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}